# Sub-Agents (Mandatory)

Split discrete work onto **Task** sub-agents. Do not run C++ analysis, implementation, tests, and verification all in the parent when those slices can be fully specified.

**Spawn (`Task`) for:**
- C++ / 772 / TFS domain analysis of one system — `explore` or `generalPurpose`
- Writing one module or a focused patch — `generalPurpose`
- Generating tests — `generalPurpose`
- Verifying one behavior (`cargo test` / clippy) — `shell`

**Parent agent only:**
- Write/update `tasks/todo.md`
- Integrate sub-agent results
- Final verification + `tasks/lessons.md`

Never let a sub-agent edit `tasks/todo.md` or `tasks/lessons.md`.

Skip a sub-agent only for a single-file tweak that cannot be specified without this conversation’s live context.
